[{"title":"送云山文先生吏部赴召","author":"阳枋","text":"云山至宝非和璧，光耀烛天难毖密。\n一朝天子阐坤珍，此宝肯为蜀人出。\n宝生蜀东六十年，蜀势关吴妙陈述。\n蜀为头目吴腹心，头目清明腹心佚。\n蜀为藩篱吴奥堂，藩篱坚固奥堂实。\n蜀若颠危忧在吴，夔峡岂能遏迸溢。\n自从蜀口弃三关，托里金城更崷崒。\n戎马冲奔二十年，此城处处皆屹立。\n虔刘俘掠技已穷，群聚宝峰频出入。\n抵碍坚城不得战，转攻云诏谋虚袭。\n欲践辰沅闯广南，后顾有蜀还恧尼。\n留屯汉中缀秘师，计俟万全无一失。\n我向嘉渝增重屯，大理垂军须缩绖。\n夷陵近闻列守戍，似谓蜀险为难必。\n或言东晋不用蜀，是时南北只守一。\n如今敌人斡腹来，不思保蜀更何术。\n莫虞海道要先防，云涛涌沸蛟鼋慄。\n臣宝一战振天威，至今敌胆犹惕怵。\n莫忧淮堧近建康，万柁舟师人素习。\n踏车横江臣世忠，北人言之魂凛凓。\n荆南虽云瞰大江，曹瞒百万几禽执。\n赵公堰匮孟公湖，有如弱水蓬莱岌。\n当今重势在蜀川，蜀事艰难今转急。\n井络丘墟烟火空，荆棘漫弥虎窟室。\n频年旱暵民流亡，褚无完裳瓶无粒。\n兵将愿战民效死，彼此交病财不给。\n就中活着犹可为，民心戴宋元一日。\n益兵降财劳蜀民，旒冕周咨宜委悉。\n射干狼毒漫战吻，芝朮参苓难愈疾。\n恳切深惟保蜀方，蜀苟措安国宁谧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41013,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送文大监赴召","author":"阳枋","text":"云门大卷声铿锵，不比寒谷号蛩螀。\n长笑归来书满床，著眼不用垂簪裳。\n夤缘仕版亦逢场，一鼎热处元清凉。\n年来道心包乾刚，鉴净水止无迎将。\n付物大公齐混茫，玲珑窗牖开八荒。\n霁月海东悬秋霜，照破蒙昧横津梁。\n不才赋资如点狂，柱倚宝瑟心陶唐。\n冰轮玉井情徜徉，祥云丽日希馀光。\n布帛菽粟味尤长，寻绎此乐徒激昂。\n颀然美人天西方，许我立雪来其旁。\n欲坐春风吸馀芳，听说夜话摅中肠。\n又闻催归侍玉皇，挈提北斗斟天浆。\n净洗世表尘昏黄，席此广宇归康庄。\n起舞掉头帆飞扬，誓鸣急桨随乌樯，参同希传魏伯阳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41014,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送谢方伯赴试","author":"阳枋","text":"春桑催蚕日迟迟，春蚕食叶开文闱。\n桃源虽好不可住，高人梦绕故山薇。\n金鸡啁哳唤出日，轻舟短棹风吹衣。\n莫问虹梁春燕入，莫吟西堂春草萋。\n水光山色二千里，助君笔底龙蛇飞。\n丹成九转天上去，五云胶轕黄金扉。\n回首故乡烟霭暮，城郭如故人民非。\n年来世事转头改，不见华表丁令威。\n送君南浦祝此语，伫立江干背夕晖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41015,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽乐应乃堂","author":"阳枋","text":"高堂忆昨燕春风，双老怡愉桂棹东。\n蓝袖归时饶榜绿，橘香怀处少萱红。\n悲缠忍见舟藏壑，德感还知月在空。\n有子天教优好善，五花不日贲泉宫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41016,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽伏德华主簿 其二","author":"阳枋","text":"豁达千人杰，巍峨七尺躯。\n天边期阔武，意外失华途。\n堕泪一人足，伤心二女孤。\n西溪桥畔冢，多少为嗟呼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41017,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽李致政","author":"阳枋","text":"鸥閒伴侣子夔边，锡类宗盟计百年。\n准拟归来寻旧约，不堪相送苾新阡。\n芝兰笑语龙山事，桃李樽罍象滪天。\n钟作数行临老泪，为君滴向碧溪渊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41018,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽武龙蹇巡检 其二","author":"阳枋","text":"叩户忆曾识，升堂期再寻。\n仙游诚绝往，俗虑苦盈襟。\n菡萏晚犹好，荼蘼霜不侵。\n思君望阡陇，远树白云深。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41019,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽郑广安","author":"阳枋","text":"壮节从丁卯，奇功岁转新。\n有征皆鼓勇，无战不鏖尘。\n棠国香凝月，榆关梦熟春。\n吁嗟河北地，今日尚终臣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41020,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秤锤峡","author":"阳枋","text":"秤锤盘巨石，藏重亦藏轻。\n待出持衡手，一匡天下平。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41021,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"贽鄂帅张仁简 其一","author":"阳枋","text":"八牖玲珑义理天，复斋心印妙亲传。\n化炉点处金非铁，吏坌清馀否亦贤。\n吠息蒹芦湖外月，炊生榆柳灶中烟。\n水浮鄂渚连牛渚，公子行行天上仙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41022,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谒九江周元公祠嗣性善度先生韵","author":"阳枋","text":"圣贤随遇即成都，仰止宗师谒故居。\n面揖光风江渚远，心涵霁月海天舒。\n图由自得前无画，道未尝亡今有书。\n共立斜阳归去晚，当年与点意何如。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41023,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谒九江赵守","author":"阳枋","text":"浮舟湓浦春，民谣举欣欣。\n问民宁底乐，州有贤使君。\n帝胄擢清班，江国烦慇勤。\n仪型金玉相，肝肠锦绣纹。\n周南蔼忠厚，大雅卓不群。\n固本屹磐石，理兵无丝棼。\n城坚万里长，气壮三边军。\n短吟亟搜枯，弄斧当郢斤。\n聊此窥一斑，所见谐所闻。\n愿公慨神州，边腹久中分。\n五岳判地气，三光离天文。\n倒竭五湖波，一洗九陵氛。\n钟彝勒伟晔，汗史照芳芬。\n此烈丈夫耳，循常奚足云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41024,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谒同年许使君德开 其一","author":"阳枋","text":"人人属目快星凰，倚棹溪头起漫郎。\n强仕惯闻纡郡绂，缀班希有擅文场。\n剩栽棠荫两江绿，重著蓝袍再世光。\n人物西清自华选，未应琴鹤久松岗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41025,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谒夔门桂帅 其一","author":"阳枋","text":"阃歌整暇化清夷，笑把宗师正印提。\n绣腑文章开剩馥，锦江桃李烂成蹊。\n旌摇蜀水春浮峡，柝静蛮天月满溪。\n衣衮归欤近宸极，殊勋嘉叹殿头西。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41026,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"黄池舟中和全父弟韵","author":"阳枋","text":"江上平堤堤上路，只轮来往舟沿溯。\n林疏风叶坠轻黄，征雁声中秋暗度。\n来踏东风归岁暮，佳山好水无重数。\n揩摩老眼待冬深，更看霜林排雪树。\n岸木稠边屋作邻，港鱼多处鸥成聚。\n竿蓑拟欲个中留，却恨冬风催我去。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41027,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"棕花","author":"阳枋","text":"满株擐甲诧棕榈，叶展蒲葵冬不枯。\n鬼发擘开纤玉掌，蚌胎剖破细琼珠。\n熟煨炉火香于笋，白饤盘银美似酥。\n珍膳莫充禅客供，恐猜鱼子放江湖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41028,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游下竺飞来峰和存子侄韵","author":"阳枋","text":"嵯峨擅北高，幽静还西竺。\n虎蹲石根奇，龙蟠藤蔓曲。\n面横白水湖，背列浓岚谷。\n鸟碎山逾空，起予诗不俗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41029,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"腊月二十八日与知宗提举分岁郡中啜茶于北楼赏梅于忠献堂知宗即席有诗次韵并简提舶","author":"王十朋","text":"老病踰年卧晋江，耽诗性癖未能降。\n园林牢落梅经眼，岁月峥嵘酒满缸。\n堂上焚香敬勋德，楼头回首念家乡。\n黄柑未拜萧嵩赐，乡味分珍谩一双。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41030,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谢涪陵刘君举使君见委北岩堂长诗","author":"阳枋","text":"雪片冬深玩易编，正公和气理尤浑。\n八分写就龙蛇走，岩藤涧树常蜒蜿。\n莲荡飘裾紫阳学，归来拂拭莓苔痕。\n岩前世事几兴废，道无今古终长存。\n新来五马栽桃李，生平伊洛期穷源。\n下车一笑抚江阁，片心飞度苍崖根。\n生香动荡满幽谷，秋丛濯雨抽兰荪。\n露华滴晴舞夜鹤，云叶卷霁吟朝猿。\n衰翁白首野人服，不爱市井怜山村。\n太守招来说好语，翠萝有路犹堪扪。\n听终不敢谢疲苶，瘦筇强拄岩檐门。\n遗书欲傍梅花读，祇恐使人昭昭己昏昏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41031,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赋赵守接竹引岩泉","author":"阳枋","text":"冰丝宝瑟无胶柱，事省庭空引泉注。\n为爱心随水色清，从教竹傍山腰去。\n循除㶁㶁听潺湲，华襟湛彻生灵根。\n纵使波深池自满，尚嫌鲤跃圆荷翻。\n破除崖岸非落泊，虚室融融自出白。\n通塞默知个里心，媸妍各付水中色。\n自来道体如泉流，昼夜不舍无春秋。\n希音解入幽人听，世间俗耳徒箜篌。\n沈沈夜永寒声出，宫商寡和鸣琮璧。\n山高月冷天地空，寸地希夷无畛域。\n架竹主人还记年，山下出泉常不乾。\n凡物有本自无息，对泉玩理高怀宽。\n先生仁念泉初达，苍生镇尔铜乌渴。\n太空一滴著人清，生意汪洋湖海阔。\n野人不作名利贪，饮水曲肱心自甘。\n时乞一瓯空煮茗，快读羲经井九三。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41032,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"避地云山全父弟诗寄梅花 其一","author":"阳枋","text":"入秋烽火无虚日，问谷寻岩陪隐逸。\n水冷山深梅已花，忙中不觉年华易。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41033,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"避地云山全父弟诗寄梅花 其三","author":"阳枋","text":"看花岩下兴偏长，不减西湖水月光。\n镇坐绝无尘一点，寿阳深笑靓宫妆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41034,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"念奴娇 丁卯中元作示儿","author":"阳枋","text":"白尽蒹葭，衰从蒲柳，我只松筠节。\n君民尧舜，老翁揩眼勋业。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41035,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"临江仙 涪州北岩玩易有感","author":"阳枋","text":"乐意相关莺对语，春风遍满天涯。\n生香不断树交花。\n个中皆实理，何处是浮华。\n收敛回来还夜气，一轮明月千家。\n看梅休用隔窗纱。\n清光辉皎洁，疏影自横斜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41036,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其四","author":"阳枋","text":"霹雳一声风卷去，谁家水馆夕阳天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41037,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其七","author":"阳枋","text":"白云无心閒渡水，清风何意自开花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41038,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其三","author":"阳枋","text":"岂但流王泽，应须沃朕心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41039,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"阳枋","text":"五载弹冠尚觉忙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41040,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"阳枋","text":"文章不数向歆辈，姓字须教班马香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41041,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其五","author":"阳枋","text":"饱谙风月归，庶几无虚还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41042,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"仲子枋试晬取墨","author":"阳景春","text":"俚俗儿周晬，罗陈试子材。\n怡愉观物色，拣择取烟煤。\n志在文章富，毫挥锦绣开。\n弟兄心笔砚，予岂怨贫哉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41043,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和伯高弟梦宗氏子寄生舍下","author":"阳景春","text":"黑貂敝色嗟苏郎，苦茶两饼话难详。\n老妪糟糠未鼎肉，漫劳戏綵啼其傍。\n造物寄意知何许，慈竹生舍贻吉祥。\n晚年慰见万事足，无乃宗子为小阳。\n当时顾后悲不孝，今日儿女还成行。\n难弟二珠奇男子，已角既鹿未角獐。\n先人有后欲昌炽，绎思为善宁无常。\n菊开佳色采盈手，酒浮蚁绿仍鹅黄。\n喜有诗书起门户，佳兴吹入秋风长。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41044,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"阳景春","text":"五十三年堕鬓魂，一朝埋玉骨方温。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41045,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"阳景春","text":"诗书有味嚼逾美，编简无花开自香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41046,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"齐术","text":"零陵太守吟情逸，惟过浯溪未有诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41047,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"齐贤良","text":"依微谢女吟来雪，零落襄王梦后云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41048,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十咏 其二","author":"齐唐","text":"远适庐陵郡，重江去不穷。\n全家片帆底，三月怒涛中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41049,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十咏 其一","author":"齐唐","text":"远适庐陵郡，经旬泛楚天。\n江山晴绕枕，星斗夜随船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41050,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"乌江庙","author":"齐唐","text":"天意降时雨，山川潜出云。\n锄秦将授汉，此力半因君。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41051,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"仙茅","author":"齐唐","text":"仙方上品誇灵种，忽怪灵芝拆紫苞。\n玉泽返婴看验术，少微山是小三茅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41052,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"披云楼","author":"齐唐","text":"元和文物盛群贤，曾借蓬莱住列仙。\n画入帘栊烟外寺，鉴摇台榭水中天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41053,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"登狼山阁","author":"齐唐","text":"海腹藏吴楚，天枢转斗牛。\n夜分惊日浴，潮落见鲸游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41054,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题上虞南塔院","author":"齐唐","text":"雁级指高冥，登瞻地域灵。\n路寻沧海断，山带沃洲青。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41055,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观潮","author":"齐唐","text":"何意滔天苦作威，狂驱海若走冯夷。\n因看平地波翻起，知是沧浪鼎沸时。\n初似长平万瓦震，忽如圆峤六鳌移。\n直应待得澄如练，会有安流往济时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41056,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"越州通判厅事后新凿方井","author":"齐唐","text":"卧龙山脚寒岩底，沮洳泥涂不记年。\n疏引一朝逢智匠，坐令咫尺变璇渊。\n待时藏用怀灵德，济物施功假世贤。\n留作越人歌咏事，召棠阴下酌贪泉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41057,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题禹庙","author":"齐唐","text":"削断龙门剑力闲，遗祠终古鉴湖边。\n昆墟到海曾穷地，石穴藏书不记年。\n春色门墙花滴雨，晓光台殿水浮烟。\n涂山万国梯航集，告禅灵坛岂偶然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41058,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"玉洞","author":"齐唐","text":"白石洞间路，吾家在其中。\n琴窗与书阁，一半是云封。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41059,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"石伞峰书堂","author":"齐唐","text":"伞峰一片崎危石，枕在青冥绝壁间。\n人作盐梅资世济，迹留岩岫与云闲。\n露盘高出长年殿，羽盖斜临宛委山。\n藐矣诸孙愧前躅，但开三径掩柴关。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41060,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"南雄城楼","author":"齐唐","text":"汉初开郡出南夷，万壑千岩足崄巇。\n天上斗牛应共域，人间江岭自分岐。\n尉佗椎髻遗风俗，马援飞鸢堕水时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41061,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送张尊师监龙瑞宫","author":"齐唐","text":"阳明洞天三月春，桃花艳艳迎笑人。\n仙官瑶裾翠羽裾，直上非烟骖紫麟。\n手把赤书秘玉文，朝谒太素三元君。\n琳房窈窕出青云，众真啸语林际闻。\n山精木魅知有主，敛戢鬼火摧飙轮。\n崇岩绝壑足清放，抗迹万里无埃尘。\n物不疵疠年谷熟，绰约曾潜姑射神。\n祈师努力学此道，下济泽国穷鳏民。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41062,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"长葺圣寿寺","author":"齐唐","text":"建中天子寄弥纶，筑隐商岩旧叶存。\n麟笔有文藏册府，驷车流庆属衡门。\n金绳宝构新空界，剑树真游接古原。\n藐矣诸孙愧前躅，脱身仍谢北山猿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41063,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其三","author":"章得象","text":"唯有梅花报春早，雪中传信过江干。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41064,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"齐唐","text":"载水寒流对轩槛，桃源深径入渔樵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41065,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十二","author":"齐唐","text":"身闲婚嫁毕，秋老蟹螯肥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41066,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其四","author":"齐唐","text":"新筑堤成号杜塘，结茅深稳佔湖光。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41067,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"齐唐","text":"楩楠非给燎，鱮鲂必施罛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41068,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十一","author":"齐唐","text":"岁贵波然素，时珍蟹有箱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41069,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其八","author":"齐唐","text":"偃藩唯觉讼铃虚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41070,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其三","author":"齐唐","text":"纤纶鱼罗尾，鸣镞雉摧班。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41071,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其七","author":"齐唐","text":"飞栋新成蘸碧轩，会稽山脚照湖边。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41072,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十","author":"齐唐","text":"剑水清凉梦笔山，戟衣照日启重关。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41073,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十三","author":"齐唐","text":"春波池上支琴荐，秋月桐阴把蟹螯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41074,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其五","author":"齐唐","text":"扫拂渔蓬出泾来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41075,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其六","author":"齐唐","text":"独坐涧边听水落，却来洞口看云生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41076,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"呈云盖智禅师","author":"齐禅师","text":"说法无如这个亲，十方刹海一微尘。\n若能于此明真理，大地何曾见一人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41077,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"临寂偈","author":"齐禅师","text":"昨夜三更过急滩，滩头云雾黑漫漫。\n一条拄杖为知己，击碎千关与万关。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41078,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"如归亭","author":"齐廓","text":"翚飞绮构成，宾至得佳名。\n岫列千螺出，江涵匹练平。\n吟看客帆度，坐见钓舟横。\n独倚雕阑外，令人心骨清。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41079,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]